OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPredominantly cloudy with a
OL,6,Fchance of patchy light rain or drizzle
OL,7,Fanywhere, although along the coast the
OL,8,Frain is likely to become more
OL,9,Fpersistent. Feeling damp and rather
OL,10,Fcool, despite light winds and
OL,11,Ftemperatures close to average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThis evening the rain becomes
OL,14,Fmore widespread, while remaining
OL,15,Fmainly light. The rain persists for
OL,16,Fmany areas overnight. Light winds and
OL,17,Fstaying relatively mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
