OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FWet start for many places, but
OL,6,Fthe rain becomes light and patchy
OL,7,Fthrough the morning, then mostly fades
OL,8,Faway through the afternoon with
OL,9,Fperhaps some bright spells developing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,12,Fdry Monday and Tuesday with variable
OL,13,Fcloud and sunny spells once overnight
OL,14,Ffog clears. Wednesday cloudy with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain. Temperatures
OL,16,Fremaining close to average with
OL,17,Fgenerally light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
